#: main.cpp:34
msgid ""
"A program by Éric Bischoff <ebischoff@nerim.net>\n"
"\n"
"This program is dedicated to humorist Michael Moore, for he\n"
"knows that money does not justify anything...\n"
"\n"
"Time Genie exchange rates courtesy of <a href='http://www.timegenie.com/' "
"title='foreign exchange rates courtesy of Time Genie'>Time Genie</a>\n"
msgstr ""
"En Program vun Éric Bischoff <ebischoff@nerim.net>\n"
"\n"
"Dit Programm is den Pliebaas Michael Moore toeegt, he\n"
"weet, dat Geld nich allens rechtfardigen deit…\n"
"\n"
"Dank an \"Time Genie\" för de op <a href='http://deu.timegenie.com/' "
"title='Dank för de Wesselkursen'>Time Genie</a> praatstellt Wesselkursen.\n"

